The books under wasm3/ depend on the pinned wasm-acl2 tree, which is not in this
repository; they are certified by `make -C wasm3` with the pin in place, and are
excluded from a community certification run.  The books under milawa-lisp/ and
machine/ have no external dependencies and are certified as usual.

This is the arrangement section 3.4 of books/projects/milawa/VERIFIED-WASM-LISP.md
describes: a pinned external dependency is never assumed to be present.
